WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.190
Every employee can see the organization and who has logged in today, not who is online now.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:13.110
An employee can open their own profile, work details and sample personnel documents.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:19.110
A colleague's work profile is visible, but their personnel documents remain restricted.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:26.030
Authorized HR can preview document placeholders. No real PAN or Aadhaar is published.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:31.350
Employees can access policies by year. Earlier versions are retained rather than replaced.

